// Build settings for the Express app target (apps/ios/project.yml's configFiles).
//
// GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY comes from Secrets.xcconfig, which is git-ignored: copy Secrets.example.xcconfig to
// Secrets.xcconfig and fill it in. GitHub CI (scripts/ci/ios.sh) writes it from the GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY secret,
// and Xcode Cloud, which builds TestFlight releases, from its GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY secret environment variable
// (ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh). Without it the app builds and shows "Map unavailable".
GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
